# AgentShip demo — provider credentials template.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   # then edit .env and fill in your real key
#
# The `agentship run` CLI (and `make demo`) load a `.env` from the current directory
# automatically, so running an agent picks up the key set here. This file
# (.env.example) is the committed template; the filled-in `.env` is gitignored and
# must never be committed.
#
# This demo is LIVE: every agent (agents/*.yaml) uses openai/gpt-4o-mini and every
# `make demo` / `make test` run calls the real OpenAI API, so you need a real key:
#
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
